-g8BAx2pfxWmqZ-OAfiNrp8BoV7LZrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7f2Em3l8rNuirNr-oWYH9OI5PsNQcBnLoQuP0XMwG6sA&oe=6A145332"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TOlS5UClYc8Q7kNvwGdQV84&_nc_oc=AdrgnHV4lNAV-9bdL8oe6-_EKXsqCn_ozjyJhvDLFE_8NWNqgG1Ns1RKvbQA6366RlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6ZR0fvPymmMq7rnne-i3C0_ACnuDwTZaRHKRxh2abagA&oe=6A147897"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G0qvJ33hbnkQ7kNvwGsJ6WV&_nc_oc=Adp9bQpXxXuYsoLCZKrYvslE8fp56jHdbW4DqLpol0va-0PltDimEZxTFBxX_RIC77I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_zjBcSEGMjmVFByidqBM_pzLKQa8Swj1MFYIPIe1H-A&oe=6A144595"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MVNBvJCjJwsQ7kNvwE09m6o&_nc_oc=AdrVgi5b2FSHtbqIbDhp2Oj3i-RTZuyLKZXSkgsmn8RLxoEfaFfar6qHlnGXg_GhHx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6uafO55UxO9MDpQcKJB0htYEL_Yz5ij9ffJSh_GBUjDQ&oe=6A145942"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=24faiF_hc7UQ7kNvwFEORj8&_nc_oc=AdpVbNdydiG4hFu7dUvVx7xOokqZp0JkQD5pppE2tbOJwHc9ymwbi65BNir-H-z_yoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4wZqVnx2q_9oaQYU25ahE9ZwY7Q8Yjlnt7sdwgXYiatQ&oe=6A147804"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rBM_e5sjtSQQ7kNvwHhJcEQ&_nc_oc=AdrGWLSPNZfqYZwQgxwXsWojm2jlmr-5f6WQ0jt8aqKyQk7xMnzLpSwBc0ubHo9